00:46:25.260 --> 00:46:28.200
are, in fact, precisely--

00:46:28.200 --> 00:46:30.420
in a resource allocation,
they are precisely

00:46:30.420 --> 00:46:33.630
the marginal utilities
of the things.

00:46:33.630 --> 00:46:35.410
So you'd say, oh,
no, I'm using--

00:46:35.410 --> 00:46:36.940
I'm solving the dual problem.

00:46:36.940 --> 00:46:38.290
And you could blabber on and on.

00:46:38.290 --> 00:46:42.430
And you'd say, also, plus
