00:46:47.980 --> 00:46:51.520
So should be--

00:46:51.520 --> 00:46:53.500
I should be a factor
of 5 cubed better.

00:46:53.500 --> 00:46:55.143
I should be 100x faster.

00:46:55.143 --> 00:46:56.185
Everybody following this?

00:46:56.185 --> 00:46:57.460
This is what someone might say.

00:46:57.460 --> 00:46:59.252
And actually, people
say this all the time.

00:46:59.252 --> 00:47:01.120
It's completely
wrong, of course.

00:47:01.120 --> 00:47:04.660
So OK.

00:47:04.660 --> 00:47:06.082
So we'll solve this method.

00:47:06.082 --> 00:47:07.540
And then you get
down, and you say,

00:47:07.540 --> 00:47:09.430
oh, look, you started from a
