00:47:20.800 --> 00:47:22.510
In some cases, it's easy.

00:47:22.510 --> 00:47:24.790
In the simple resource
allocation, it's easy.

00:47:24.790 --> 00:47:25.970
In others, it's not.

00:47:25.970 --> 00:47:26.470
OK.

00:47:26.470 --> 00:47:29.890
Everybody following this?

00:47:29.890 --> 00:47:33.580
Then they'd say, oh, look,
