00:47:42.760 --> 00:47:43.810
Everybody following this?

00:47:43.810 --> 00:47:47.550
So I have heard people
say this to each other

00:47:47.550 --> 00:47:49.320
or put this in slides.

00:47:49.320 --> 00:47:51.900
It turns out it's all
